{"id":"nigde","lemma":"нигде","pos":"adv","rank":1223,"glosses":["nowhere"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ea/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я нигде не могу это найти.","en":"I can't find it anywhere.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to find"}]},{"text":"Мы не видели её нигде.","en":"We didn't see her anywhere.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},{"g":"her"},null]},{"text":"Ты нигде не будешь в безопасности.","en":"You won't be safe anywhere.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"safety","l":"безопасность"}]},{"text":"Ты нигде не видел мои очки?","en":"Have you seen my glasses anywhere?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"glasses, spectacles"}]},{"text":"Его нигде не было видно.","en":"It was nowhere to be seen.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"it is visible"}]}]}